## 5. Lightning Experience — UI Overview

Lightning Experience is Salesforce's modern interface. Key elements:

| UI Element | Purpose |
|-----------|---------|
| **App Launcher (⊞)** | Opens all available apps (Sales, Service, etc.) |
| **Navigation Bar** | Quick access to Objects — Accounts, Contacts, Leads |
| **Seller Home** | Personal dashboard — tasks, deals, performance |
| **Kanban View** | Drag-and-drop pipeline board for Opportunities |
| **Global Search** | Instantly find any record across all Objects |

**List Views vs Reports:**

| Feature | List View | Report |
|---------|-----------|--------|
| Best for | Quick filtered record view | Deep analysis + charts |
| Complexity | Simple | Advanced |
| Output | Table | Table + charts + summaries |

