## 6. Trailhead Playground Setup

The **Trailhead Playground** is a free practice Salesforce org — completely separate
from any real/production environment.

**How to get one:**
- Click **"Launch"** on any Trailhead module → Playground is auto-created

**Installing challenge packages:**
- Each module provides a **Package ID** starting with `04t`
- Always copy it directly from the module page
- Installation URL:
  ```
  https://YOUR-PLAYGROUND.lightning.force.com/packaging/installPackage.apexp?p0=04tXXXXXXXX
  ```
- Verify: `Setup → Quick Find → Installed Packages`

> ⚠️ Always use Playground — NEVER a production org for training exercises.

